  "charterPage.footerCompanyLine": "iHYPE Inc. · Founded Portland, ME · 2026 ·",
  "charterPage.makesRealBody": "A charter is just a promise on paper until a fan buys a ticket. Every dollar that hits this split exists because someone hyped an artist, showed up, and paid face value instead of going through a scalper. Artists write the songs, venues open the doors — but fans are the ones who make the 70/20/10 mean anything at all.",
